  "question": {
    "text": "The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>r</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math>&nbsp;is non-zero real number and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>r</mi></mfenced></math> denotes the greatest integer less than or equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;is equal to :"
  },
