  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>r</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></gwmw></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8942;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8942;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8942;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>On adding all the above inequalities, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>r</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>r</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>r</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So, by Sandwich Theorem, we can conclude that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>r</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
